 Object
 ------
 Object is any entity that has its own properties/state or function/behaviour

 class
 -----
 a java definition block that is used to define states and behaviour of an object
 states are handled using variables , behaviour is handled using methods.

 class Customer
 {
    custId
    custName
    custEmail
    custAddr
    custNum
    
    
    login()
    logout()
    addTo()
    payment()
 }
 
