 Constructor
 -----------
 Special type of a method which has same name as that of the class, no return type
 no access specifiers like(static, strictfp,default,final)
 
 If a class doesn't have a constructor a default constr will be introduced by the compiler
 
 constructors are called when the object is created.
 
 constr used for initializing non static variables
 
 steps of java program execution
 ---------------------------------
 1. .java -> compile -> .class -> jvm
 2. class loading(bootstrap,extension,application-> linking -> initialization)
 3. scan all static members and load in meta space
 4. execute static block
 5. call main
 6. static members are ready to use
 7. obj creation 
 8. non static block execute // rarely used for intialiaton of non static members
 9. constructor executes // freq used for intialiaton of non static members
 10. non static elements ready to use
